									<div class="post" id="post-69">
					<h2 class="post_title"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/outside-entertaining-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Outside Entertaining on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">Outside Entertaining on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></h2>
					
					<div class="metadata">
						<span class="time"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/outside-entertaining-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Outside Entertaining on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">12:25 pm</a></span> on 
						<span class="date">June 12 2012</span>,
						<span class="comments"><span>Comments Off</span></span>
						<br />
						By <span class="author">admin1</span>
						<br />
						Filed in: <span class="cat"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/air-dates/" title="View all posts in Air dates" rel="category tag">Air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/family-topics/" title="View all posts in Family topics" rel="category tag">Family topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/lifestyle/" title="View all posts in lifestyle" rel="category tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/lifestyle-topics/" title="View all posts in Lifestyle topics" rel="category tag">Lifestyle topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/outside-living/" title="View all posts in Outside living" rel="category tag">Outside living</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/programming/" title="View all posts in Programming" rel="category tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/show-topics/" title="View all posts in Show topics" rel="category tag">Show topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-tv-show/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-tv/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints TV" rel="category tag">Viewpoints TV</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></span>
						<br />
						<span class="tags">Tagged with: <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/air-dates-2/" rel="tag">air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/lifestyle/" rel="tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/lifestyle-topics-2/" rel="tag">lifestyle topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/outside-living/" rel="tag">Outside living</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/program-topics/" rel="tag">Program topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/programming/" rel="tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/show-topics-2/" rel="tag">show topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-show/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-tv/" rel="tag">Viewpoints TV</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></span>
					</div><!-- class="metadata" -->
					
					
					
					<div class="entry">
						<p>Are your outside living areas ready to entertain guests? The weather is more pleasant now and people are getting together to enjoy barbeques and other outside fun. The porch, patio or lanai might need a little sprucing up. Home repair and decorating stores are still having sales on most items needed to make the most of outdoor living. The <a title="Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" href="http://viewterryb.tumblr.com/" target="_blank">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a> television show offers a series on bringing the inside out to give viewers more ideas about how to make outdoor living more functional and comfortable.</p>
<div id="attachment_70" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 298px"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/outdoor-living.jpg"><img src="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/outdoor-living.jpg" class="size-full wp-image-70" title="viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-and-outdoor-living" alt="viewpoints-tv" width="288" height="175" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">It is outside living season and Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw has some great tips to make it easy</p></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Terry Bradshaw, former pro ball player, is the host and narrator. He was the first pick in the 1970 NFL draft from the small and relatively unknown Louisiana Tech, which the Pittsburgh Steelers grabbed. He was their dominating quarterback from 1970-1983, leading the team to four Super Bowl titles and eight AFC Central championships. He was a  two-time Super Bowl MVP and three-time Pro Bowl selection, and was inducted into the Pro Football Hall of Fame in 1989, his first eligible year. Bradshaw retired in 1984 and has worked in sports broadcasting for more than 20 years. He is also a spokesperson for Nutrisystem and a favorite on the motivational speaking circuit.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw television show reviews topics that are entertaining and educational. It films in the United States and airs on regional and national business oriented cable networks. More information is available at viewtb.com.</p>
						<div class="spacer">&nbsp;</div>
					</div><!-- class="entry" -->
					
					
										
				</div><!-- class="post" -->
							<div class="post" id="post-65">
					<h2 class="post_title"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/kicking-addiction-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Kicking Addiction on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">Kicking Addiction on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></h2>
					
					<div class="metadata">
						<span class="time"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/kicking-addiction-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Kicking Addiction on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">12:38 pm</a></span> on 
						<span class="date">June 11 2012</span>,
						<span class="comments"><span>Comments Off</span></span>
						<br />
						By <span class="author">admin1</span>
						<br />
						Filed in: <span class="cat"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/air-dates/" title="View all posts in Air dates" rel="category tag">Air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/family-health/" title="View all posts in family health" rel="category tag">family health</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/family-topics/" title="View all posts in Family topics" rel="category tag">Family topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/lifestyle/" title="View all posts in lifestyle" rel="category tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/programming/" title="View all posts in Programming" rel="category tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/show-topics/" title="View all posts in Show topics" rel="category tag">Show topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-tv-show/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-tv/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints TV" rel="category tag">Viewpoints TV</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></span>
						<br />
						<span class="tags">Tagged with: <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/air-dates-2/" rel="tag">air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/family-health/" rel="tag">family health</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/family-wellness/" rel="tag">family wellness</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/lifestyle/" rel="tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/program-topics/" rel="tag">Program topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/programming/" rel="tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/show-topics-2/" rel="tag">show topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-show/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw-show/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw show</a></span>
					</div><!-- class="metadata" -->
					
					
					
					<div class="entry">
						<p>Anyone who has been or is addicted to something knows how hard it is to break it. The physical and psychological desire for whatever is it one is hooked on can be overwhelming and difficult to kick. Habits are hard to break and it takes re-training of the brain, strong support and sometimes medication, in order to overcome it.  The <a title="Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" href="http://viewterryb.tumblr.com/" target="_blank">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a> television show explores the topic with featured guests who are experts in the field.</p>
<div id="attachment_66" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 310px"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/break-smoking-habit.jpg"><img src="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/break-smoking-habit-300x203.jpg" class="size-medium wp-image-66" title="viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-kicking-addiction" alt="viewpoints-tv-and-addiction" width="300" height="203" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Kicking addiction out of your life on the Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw show</p></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Viewpoints TV host Terry Bradshaw is one of the most respected sport celebrities in the nation. He was the quarterback for the Pittsburgh Steelers and instrumental in leading them to four Super Bowl wins. The man with the powerful passing arm was also named the NFL’s Most Valuable Player in 1978 and also named All Pro and All-AFC that same year. His professional football career was honored with an induction in the Hall of Fame. Bradshaw retired in 1984 and he has worked in sports broadcasting for more than 20 years. He also has appeared in several films including Failure to Launch (2006) with Matthew McConaughey and Sarah Jessica Parker.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The engaging television program covers topics that are relevant in everyday life. The Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw show films in the United States and airs regionally and nationally on business oriented cable networks. More information about the program and its host is available at viewtb.com or on its Facebook page.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
						<div class="spacer">&nbsp;</div>
					</div><!-- class="entry" -->
					
					
										
				</div><!-- class="post" -->
							<div class="post" id="post-61">
					<h2 class="post_title"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/new-urbanism-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to New Urbanism on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">New Urbanism on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></h2>
					
					<div class="metadata">
						<span class="time"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/2012/06/new-urbanism-on-viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to New Urbanism on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw">2:51 pm</a></span> on 
						<span class="date">June 8 2012</span>,
						<span class="comments"><span>Comments Off</span></span>
						<br />
						By <span class="author">admin1</span>
						<br />
						Filed in: <span class="cat"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/air-dates/" title="View all posts in Air dates" rel="category tag">Air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/family-topics/" title="View all posts in Family topics" rel="category tag">Family topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/lifestyle/" title="View all posts in lifestyle" rel="category tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/new-urbanism-communities/" title="View all posts in new urbanism communities" rel="category tag">new urbanism communities</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/programming/" title="View all posts in Programming" rel="category tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/show-topics/" title="View all posts in Show topics" rel="category tag">Show topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/the-environment/" title="View all posts in the environment" rel="category tag">the environment</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-tv-show/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show" rel="category tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw TV Show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-tv/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints TV" rel="category tag">Viewpoints TV</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-tb/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with TB" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with TB</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/category/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" title="View all posts in Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" rel="category tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a></span>
						<br />
						<span class="tags">Tagged with: <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/air-dates-2/" rel="tag">air dates</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/environmental-topics/" rel="tag">environmental topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/lifestyle/" rel="tag">lifestyle</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/new-urbanism-communities/" rel="tag">new urbanism communities</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/program-topics/" rel="tag">Program topics</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/programming/" rel="tag">Programming</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/the-environment/" rel="tag">the environment</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-show/" rel="tag">Viewpoints Terry Bradshaw show</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-tb/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with TB</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a>, <a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/tag/viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw-show/" rel="tag">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw show</a></span>
					</div><!-- class="metadata" -->
					
					
					
					<div class="entry">
						<p>What is new urbanism all about? This is new way of creating living places.  It is a sustainable community where everything is within a short distance or walking distance of each other. Some new urban communities use gold carts only to get from place to place. Gas and grocery stores are within an easy commute. New urban communities rely on using transportation that uses less gas and oil and therefore reduces emissions. The <a title="Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" href="http://www.facebook.com/pages/Viewpoints-with-Terry-Bradshaw/333274666709739" target="_blank">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a> television program features these new communities that are popping up all over the country. Show host Terry Bradshaw takes the town tour along with the audience and learns what makes these great places to live, play and work.</p>
<div id="attachment_62" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 234px"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/new-urbanism-example.jpg"><img src="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/new-urbanism-example.jpg" class="size-full wp-image-62" title="viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-and-new-urbanism-example" alt="viewpoints-tv" width="224" height="167" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">New urbanism on Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</p></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The charismatic narrator and pro ball Hall of Fame inductee was the leading quarterback for the Pittsburgh Steelers. Bradshaw was instrumental in guiding the team to four Super Bowl wins and he earned the ‘Most Valuable Player” twice in his 14 year career for it. His skill on the grid iron is still valued today and he is known as one of the most respected sports celebrities in the nation. Bradshaw retired in 1984 and has steadily worked as a sports commentator for more than 20 years. He is one of the famous spokespeople for Nutrisystem and a popular motivational speaker.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Viewpoints TV show explores topics that are interesting and educational. The enlightening television program films throughout the country and airs on regional and national business oriented cable networks. More information about Terry Bradshaw and the show is available at viewtb.com.</p>
						<div class="spacer">&nbsp;</div>
