					</div><!-- class="metadata" -->
					
					
					
					<div class="entry">
						<p>It does not take much for one person to make a difference when it comes to keeping an eye on the environment.  A simple walk will yield a full trash bag of litter.  The <a title="Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw" href="http://viewterryb.tumblr.com/" target="_blank">Viewpoints with Terry Bradshaw</a>television program reports on the steps businesses and individuals can take to improve the environment one person or one business at a time. Through featured guests, the enlightening show explores innovative recycling processes, improved landfill techniques and other technologically advanced concepts that are making a difference.</p>
<div id="attachment_51" class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 204px"><a href="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/eye-on-environment.jpg"><img src="http://viewpointswithterrybradshaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/eye-on-environment.jpg" class="size-full wp-image-51" title="viewpoints-terry-bradshaw-eye-on-environment" alt="viewpoints-with-terry-bradshaw" width="194" height="260" /></a><p class="wp-caption-text">Keep an eye on the environment with Viewpoints TV</p></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The show host is sports legend Terry Bradshaw. Widely known throughout the country as the daring Pittsburgh Steelers quarterback, Bradshaw helped lead the team to four Super Bowl wins and earned an induction in to the Hall of Fame. Bradshaw spent 14 years with the NFL before he retired. He has since been a regular on sports shows for more than 20 years, authored several books and is one of the famous spokespeople for Nutrisystem.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Viewpoints TV reviews and explores topics that have an impact on the daily lives of the audience. The educational television show films in the United States and airs on regional and national business related cable networks. For more information about the show or its host, please visit viewtb.com.</p>
